            "review_text": "Intan\n1 contribution\n2\nDelicious bo la lot!\nJun 2019 • Friends\nEver since I saw Mark Wiens video, I knew, I need to try it when I'm in HCM, despite our best effort to try the local foods, still bo la lot left, so being determined, we went for bo la lot on the way to airport for our return flight, equipped with airtight container!!\n\nWhen we reached they give us their very simple English menu, there only a few choices, I remember reading bo la lot set was VND75,000/set. since I wanted to bring it back, i didn't need the set (i presumed what they meant with sets, were veggies, rice papers, sauces, etc). i wanted the bo la lot only, so after tried to explain so many times, so many ways, few body languages all failed. \nLuckily there was one of the local guest, a nice lady who stepped up & help us to become our translator. Through her we found out for 5pcs of bo la lot, the price are VND45,000, after that, all things were smooth sailing! We ate few pieces at the airport before checked it in our luggage & it was delicious, it's worth the effort to get it!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 4, 2019",
