            "review_title": "Review at Co Lieng Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Joan A\n3 contributions\n0\nGo with a local...\nApr 2019\nFour stars for the taste- the bo la lot and bo mo chai were delicious; however, disappointed in the service. I wasn’t expecting the cleanest restaurant experience here, but also wasn’t ok with the little roaches crawling so close to my food. \n\nAnd, as another reviewer mentioned, I believe there is a different menu price for foreigners and locals. On top of this, we were overcharged on our bill by 100 VND and the server began pulling money out of my husband’s hand. Although we questioned the bill, we lacked the language skills and the energy to continue arguing with the server. \n\nAlso, we both experienced stomach pains after the meal...but, if you do check this place out, please go with a local.\nRead more\nWritten April 6, 2019",
