            "review_text": "qksydney\nSydney89 contributions\n0\nBeautiful food and beautiful people\nJan 2019 • Family\nThis was the last stop on our food safari today. We had already eaten a lot but this was one we didn’t want to miss.\n\nWe ordered the bo la lot (beef wrapped in betel leaves and BBQ’d) and the bun beo (beef sausage) and it came in a minute. The lovely lady owner showed us how to put together the rice paper, fresh lettuce, herbs and barbecued beef. After dunking in the citrusy dipping sauce and fresh chilli, I can only describe it as a flavour explosion in my mouth. So glad we decided to stop by.\n\nWe asked them to pack up the rest to take away to have for dinner. The owner thought we didn’t like the food but I tried to explain that we couldn’t bear to leave a morsel behind! Will definitely be back and recommend to our friends.\nRead more\nWritten January 1, 2019",
